plt.plot(t, Vendite, color="black")
plt.plot(t, M, "o-", color="black", markerfacecolor="none", markersize=4)
plt.title("G.M. sales and exponential smoothing (alpha=0.25)", fontsize=10)
plt.show()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Figure 4.4 – G.M. sales and exponential smoothing of the series](04-time-series_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-12-1.png)
