  title "Extrapolation";
  series x=Anno y=Vendite;
  series x=Anno y=previsto / markers;
  refline 1998 / axis=x lineattrs=(pattern=dash);
run;
```
:::

The trend line is barely increasing; as seen before, the series shows no clear tendency, and indeed the coefficient of the variable *Codice*, the slope of the fitted line, is not statistically different from zero (p-value 0.769).

