trendqua = smf.ols("Entrate ~ Codice + I(Codice**2)", data=entrate).fit()
plt.figure(figsize=(5, 5))
plt.plot(t, entrate["Entrate"], color="black")
plt.plot(t, trendlin.fittedvalues, "o--", color="black", markerfacecolor="none", markersize=4)
plt.plot(t, trendqua.fittedvalues, "o-.", color="black", linewidth=2, markersize=4)
plt.title("Kodak revenues")
plt.show()
```

